BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Hike the Trust: Porter West Preserve
DTSTART:20261018T090000
DTEND:20261018T110000
UID:b1da619e2b4941f017b2b7d59a1e9e6a@sycamorelandtrust.org
DESCRIPTION:Join Sycamore Land Trust for our Hike the Trust hike at Porter
  West Preserve! As we trek the 2.5 mile upland loop\, we’ll see how this
  landscape continues to evolve: shaped by past storms\, shifting plant com
 munities\, and the steady processes of forest succession. We’ll take tim
 e to botanize\, and keep our eyes and ears open for fall migrant birds mov
 ing through the preserve. We&#8217\;ll explore how long-term protection an
 d stewardship help ensure places like this continue to thrive.
LOCATION:Porter West Preserve
URL:https://sycamorelandtrust.org/2026/08/hike-the-trust-porter-west-prese
 rve/
X-SOURCE:Sycamore Land Trust
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Oaks in the Fall with CanopyBloomington
DTSTART:20261023T170000
DTEND:20261023T200000
UID:39a3741731d4ad6954d8990effc9f6b8@sycamorelandtrust.org
DESCRIPTION:Feel the breeze and botanize with Sycamore Land Trust and Cano
 pyBloomington during Oaks in the Fall at Amy Weingartner Branigin Peninsul
 a Preserve! We’ll focus on oak identification\, learning how to recogniz
 e different species by their leaves\, bark\, and habitat while discussing 
 their role as keystone species that support countless birds\, insects\, an
 d wildlife. CanopyBloomington’s work to grow and care for Bloomington’
 s urban forest pairs perfectly with Sycamore’s efforts to protect and re
 store natural areas across the region\, highlighting how urban and wild fo
 rests function as one connected\, thriving system!
LOCATION:Amy Weingartner Branigin Peninsula Preserve
URL:https://sycamorelandtrust.org/2026/08/oaks-in-the-fall-with-canopybloo
 mington/
X-SOURCE:Sycamore Land Trust
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
